; The one that matters. Waits at the kerb, crosses ON the green man, inside the
; markings, 1.2 m clear of the practice rings at x 0 -- so the participant can
; watch somebody do it properly before doing it themselves.
[node name="PersonCrossing" type="Node3D" parent="."]
