; --- Realism pass: the street ---------------------------------------------
; Belisha beacons either side of the crossing. Worth their four nodes: they are
; the single most recognisable "this is a crossing" cue in the built
; environment, and the crossing behaviour is one of the scored tests.

; One lamp lit one pool of pavement and left the other forty metres of street
; black, which is no use at all once night mode turns the sun off: the walk and
; the crossing both have to be lightable. One light per lamp head, all of them
; off during the day.
